'''Magical Pokémon Journey: Hot Springs Pikachu''' is the eighth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Magical Pokémon Journey]] manga created by [[Yumi Tsukirino]]. It contains the 4th and 5th bonus chapters of the manga. The chapters originally released in this book were later re-released as part of {{Vol|Magical Pokémon Journey|2}}. As a bonus, it contained a fold-out color poster which was not part of the regular volume.
__NOTOC__
==Blurb==
'''''WASH YOUR POKéMON BEFORE USE'''''

''Hazel, Grandpa, and Pikachu have a refreshing trip to the spa, where they meet a whole mess of Pikachu! There goes any chance of getting clean towels...and did you know that a wet Pikachu smells like a battery?'' 

''Then, it's Valentine's day, and who do you think is going to get chocolate? Includes bonus pages by the artist!''

